  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>",
